          <p class="golf-stayplay__dek">The stay-and-play guide pairs the courses with practical bases. For the course-design story, read the <a href="/journal/st-andrews-beach-golf-course/" class="golf-stayplay__link">St Andrews Beach deep-dive</a>.</p>
